WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.440
Unit thirteen. Rest and Quiet Time!

2
00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:08.112
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.162 --> 00:00:12.005
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.056 --> 00:00:16.153
Today we learn about Rest and Quiet Time. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:20.266
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

6
00:00:23.766 --> 00:00:27.066
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

7
00:00:30.565 --> 00:00:34.131
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

8
00:00:37.629 --> 00:00:40.896
Tired. Say it with me. Tired!

9
00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:47.926
Bedtime. Say it with me. Bedtime!

10
00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:54.627
Book. Say it with me. Book!

11
00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:01.458
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

12
00:01:04.955 --> 00:01:08.588
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

13
00:01:12.092 --> 00:01:20.377
When I am tired, my body needs rest. Quiet time with a book helps me feel calm. A regular bedtime gives me energy for the next day.

14
00:01:20.427 --> 00:01:21.688
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.944 --> 00:01:28.315
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.365 --> 00:01:29.515
Sleep!

17
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:35.379
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:36.579
Calm!

19
00:01:37.403 --> 00:01:42.212
Did you know? Your body grows and repairs itself while you sleep!

20
00:01:42.262 --> 00:01:44.329
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:52.441
Think and answer. What helps you feel calm before bed?

22
00:01:52.491 --> 00:01:53.641
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.764 --> 00:01:59.533
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.583 --> 00:02:02.211
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

